      roles test whether you can actually read a financial statement, build a simple model, and explain
      a number — not which college name sits on your degree. Treat the degree as the entry ticket and
      the model you can build as the actual audition.
    </p>
  </div>

  <h2 id="progression-ladder">The progression ladder, title by title</h2>
