  </p>

  <h2 id="vs-investment-banking">Financial analyst vs investment banking: the hours</h2>
  <p>
    This is the honest contrast that matters most if prestige and hours are both on your mind. Both
    paths use overlapping core skills — financial modelling, valuation basics, Excel fluency — but the
    weekly reality is genuinely different.
  </p>
  <div class="table-wrap">
    <table>
      <thead>
